''Unreached, memory only:'' JSONPath CTS field names beyond `result`/`results`; Yarn Spinner's program format; the exact string-compare routine behind TW5 `sort`.

The full survey with its prior-art table rests in the project's shared reports as `reports/tw5-worker-vm/evaluators-one-or-many.md`.

